### ids
# @name ids
GET {{base}}/ids/{{$guid}}

### left alone
# @name left_alone
GET {{base}}/x/{{#email}}/{{#bool}}/{{#date, X}}/{%20{#dateISO,%20{year:%20-1}}%20}

### numbers
# @name numbers
GET {{base}}/n/{{$randomInt 1 1000001}}/{{$randomInt 1 7}}/{{$randomInt 5 1000001}}/{{$randomInt 1 1000001}}

### time
# @name time
GET {{base}}/t/{{$datetime iso8601}}/{{$timestamp}}
